\page cxx C++ libraries
\brief The four C++ libraries, and how a model written once in C++ is used from both languages.

| Library | What it holds | Start here |
|---|---|---|
| libKalman | the core: models, engines, filters, integrators, solvers, controllers, routers | \ref libkalman |
| libKalmanApps | the application models, each the twin of a Python class | \ref libkalmanapps |
| libKalmanLearn | learned components: policies trained in Python, run from C++ | \ref libkalmanlearn |
| libKalmanNet | the JSON API, REST and MCP servers in C++ (`kalman-serve`) | \ref md_docs_218___net |

- \subpage md_docs_215___cxx-_library
